    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "title",
     "text": "CNA Pop-Up Event",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "datetime",
     "text": "April 17, 2026\n@ 4:00 pm\n- 6:00 pm"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/3f6a76d9-CCC-generic-pop-up-logo_200px.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/CCC-generic-pop-up-logo_200px.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Cape Cod Cannabis Pop-Up Event",
     "w": 200,
     "h": 200,
     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "Learn more about CNA Stores brands Tumble & Toke and Claravita products. Quality flower, pre-rolls, and fast-acting Live Rosin gummies and more…"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Tumble & Toke Flower & Pre-Rolls"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Every cannabis harvest is different. Even with premium genetics and expert cultivation methods, environmental factors and phenotype variation can lead to slight differences in bud size, cannabinoid content, or visual appearance. While these lots may fall short of our strict top-shelf standards, they still produce flavorful, effective flower that’s ideal for everyday use.</p><p><p><img alt=\"Super Silver Haze OG image 0\" width=\"170\" height=\"170\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://images.dutchie.com/b0b9e58a28a38399ef490ed8f3e1a7f9\" data-missing=\"not-inventoried\"><img alt=\"Tropicana Cherry image 0\" width=\"171\" height=\"171\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://images.dutchie.com/e379125f486f36400b8d3da3df02f8b8\" data-missing=\"not-inventoried\"></p></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><a href=\"/brands/tumble-toke/\"><strong>Click here to shop Tumble &amp; Toke products!</strong></a></p><hr>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Claravita Edibles, Flower & Pre-Rolls"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Through extensive research and development, we, as both consumers and producers, have perfected our infused gummies to achieve the perfect balance of effects. With the support and input of our community here in Massachusetts, we’ve fine-tuned our gummies to bring positive results to the market. We can’t wait for you to experience them.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Locally Grown Veteran Owned"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Now, we’re thrilled to announce the newest addition to the Claravita family line: our top-quality cannabis flower. Sourced from our locally grown, veteran-owned operation in Amesbury, Massachusetts, our top-shelf cannabis flower embodies our commitment to excellence and sustainability.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
